# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS and replace the team handles. With branch protection
# requiring code-owner review, a change to the framework's control plane needs a
# human owner's approval on the server, which no agent session can supply.
/.evidence/policy.json            @your-org/platform-security
/.evidence/secrets-allowlist.json @your-org/platform-security
/.evidence/changes/               @your-org/engineering-leads
/.claude/                         @your-org/platform-security
/managed-settings.json            @your-org/platform-security
/.github/workflows/               @your-org/platform-security
